Antonio and Archivo are served from this site rather than from Google Fonts, so that
no cross-origin round trip sits on the critical rendering path.

Both are licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1, which permits
redistribution and self-hosting. The files here are the woff2 subsets that the
Google Fonts css2 API serves to a current browser, copied unmodified.

  Antonio  — https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Antonio
  Archivo  — https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Archivo
  OFL 1.1  — https://openfontlicense.org/

To refresh them, re-run the css2 request in README (Search section) and replace
both static/fonts.css and these .woff2 files together.
